WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:06.800
In John's Gospel, Jesus says: before
Abraham came into existence, I AM.

2
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:09.030
His hearers pick up stones.

3
00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:13.660
Later he is arrested in a garden, and
handed over to the Roman governor, Pontius

4
00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:14.880
Pilate.

5
00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:17.760
Only Rome could order a crucifixion.

6
00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:23.860
So who wanted Jesus dead, and how did a
religious quarrel end on a Roman cross?

7
00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:26.250
In this mission, you'll
follow the conflict,

8
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:29.230
from the Temple courts
to Pilate's courtyard.

9
00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:32.500
Then you'll weigh up the claims
about who was responsible,

10
00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:35.370
and why that question still matters.

11
00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:38.900
Your mission: find out
who wanted Jesus dead,

12
00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:41.250
and why it ended on a Roman cross.
